{"title":"Bombardier Beetle","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 33 Beetle that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 5</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 6 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"beetle-mandible\" title=\"Beetle Mandible - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/8872c8debf3517cce963.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Beetle Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iridescent-carapace\" title=\"Iridescent Carapace - in 50% of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/be9151e50c9d8d997175.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iridescent Carapace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 2/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bog-pelt\" title=\"Bog Pelt - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/851eda3e442f3ed8925d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bog Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Beetle: <a href=\"#/monster/stag-beetle\">Stag Beetle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(21)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rhinoceros-beetle\">Rhinoceros Beetle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(27)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/4c7c78c99318ec394ebe.webp\" alt=\"Bombardier Beetle\"></div><h3>Bombardier Beetle</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>33 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–33)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Beetle</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>137</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>22.7</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1650</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}